  19.7s | {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cej9Vw5QYyALZ137MfFm7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PEtjebuEdt7wp2Nz2Ap9Cz","name":"mcp__hercules_ask__ask_user","input":{"questions":[{"question":"Question 1 of the interview — the shape of the app today.\n\nWhat are the clients and where does note data live right now? Specifically:\n\n- Which platforms ship today (web SPA, iOS/Android native, Electron/desktop, more than one)?\n- Where is the source of truth (server DB + REST/GraphQL API? Firebase/Supabase? already local-first?)\n- Is there any local persistence at all today (IndexedDB, SQLite, Core Data), or is it fetch-on-load with an in-memory store?\n- Roughly what's the note payload — plain text/Markdown blobs, or a structured rich-text doc (ProseMirror/Lexical/blocks)? And are attachments in scope?\n\nFree-form is fine; the options below are just common shapes.","options":["Web SPA only, server DB behind a REST API, no local persistence, Markdown notes","Web + mobile clients, server DB behind an API, some caching, rich-text/block documents","Mobile-first native app with a local DB already, syncing to a server","Something else — I'll describe it"]}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2369,"cache_read_input_tokens":17677,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2369},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55fc75c1-49b0-45a6-8f10-55c2ef87b86a","uuid":"83ea0399-7f47-4d84-b0b4-2ba44933f520","timestamp":"2026-09-04T21:57:34.782Z","request_id":"req_011Cej9VvHXoC2fsvmub2vkZ","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01PEtjebuEdt7wp2Nz2Ap9Cz","display_name":"Ask User","server_display_name":"spike"}]}
